{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds an arc of a circle to the path, specified with a radius and angles."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addArc","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"center","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Point3DV","text":"Point3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"radius","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"startAngle"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Angle2D"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"endAngle"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Angle2D"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"clockwise"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"transform"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial17AffineTransform3DV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AffineTransform3D"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .identity)"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"center","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The center of the arc, in user space coordinates.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"radius","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The radius of the arc, in user space coordinates."}]}]},{"name":"startAngle","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The angle to the starting point of the arc, measured from the positive x-axis."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"endAngle","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The angle to the end point of the arc, measured from the positive x-axis."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"clockwise","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"True to make a clockwise arc; false to make a counterclockwise arc.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"transform","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An affine transform to apply to the arc before adding to the path. Defaults to the identity transform if not specified."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method calculates starting and ending points using the radius and angles you specify, uses a sequence of cubic Bézier curves to approximate a segment of a circle between those points, and then appends those curves to the path."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The clockwise parameter determines the direction in which the arc is created; the actual direction of the final path is dependent on the transform parameter and the current transform of a context where the path is drawn."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, because OpenSwiftUI by default uses a vertically-flipped coordinate system (with the origin in the top-left of the view), specifying a clockwise arc results in a counterclockwise arc after the transformation is applied."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the path ends with an unclosed subpath, this method adds a line connecting the current point to the starting point of the arc.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If there is no unclosed subpath, this method creates a new subpath whose starting point is the starting point of the arc.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ending point of the arc becomes the new current point of the path.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path\/addArc(center:radius:startAngle:endAngle:clockwise:transform:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/path\/addarc(center:radius:startangle:endangle:clockwise:transform:)"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"addArc(center:radius:startAngle:endAngle:clockwise:transform:)","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addArc","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"center","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Point3DV","text":"Point3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"radius","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV","text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"endAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV","text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clockwise","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transform","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial17AffineTransform3DV","text":"AffineTransform3D","kind":"typ